config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_WLAN_THERMO
	bool "Domoticz plugin: WLANThermo"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_REQUESTS
	default n
	help
		temperature readings of the WLANThermo probes (grills and barbecues) (it uses requests for the HTTP API of WLANThermo).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/Domoticz-WLANThermo-Plugin, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> WLANThermo, enter the address of the device.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
